    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nhiam Kuɔth kɛnɛ nhiam Kritho Yecu min bi nɛy tin tëk kɛnɛ nɛy tin ci li̱w luk, kɛnɛ jɔacdɛ kɛnɛ kuäärɛ ɣän la̱tdä jɛ ji̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lätni ruac Kuɔth naath mi gua̱a̱th lotdɛ rɔ kiɛ /cɛ rɔ lot. Lätni jɛ naath mi cikɛ duer, bumkɛ min ŋi̱i̱cikɛ kɛ ciaaŋ mi päl piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö gua̱a̱th a bëëni, mi /ci naath ŋi̱i̱c in thuɔ̱k bi liŋ, kä duundɛ ɣöö kuukɛ ji̱thkiɛn, bikɛ rɔ̱ jëk ŋi̱eec ti ŋuan ti bikɛ la̱t ni tin nhɔk kɛn kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bikɛ rɔ̱ riet jɔk kä li̱eŋ thukä, kä bikɛ wä liŋ ni muaaŋ tëë wal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱du bumni ni ciaŋ, kä rut bɛ̈c bɛ̈ɛ̈c, lätni la̱t raam mi dääk ruac Kuɔth, kä cuupni la̱tdu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱dä ci gua̱a̱th ben kɛ ɣöö ba ɣä thöp ala muc, ci gua̱a̱th jiɛɛnädä ben. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cä ko̱r mi gɔaa tɛr, cä kööŋ thuk, cä ŋa̱th käp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A tɛmɛ ni ɛn täämɛ a wä nhiam ca kum kuäärä cuŋni tɔ̱a̱w ɣä, min bi Kuäär ni Yecu in la luuk cuŋni jɛ ka̱m ɣä ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ, kä /ciɛ ɣän kärɔa, amäni nɛy diaal tin liɛpkɛ jɔacdɛ bä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruaacni ran",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luäŋɛ ɛn ɣöö bi mal ben kä ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci Dii-mɛth min nhɔk ɣɔw ɛmɛ ɣä ba̱ny piny cɛ wä kä Thɛ-tha-lo-ni-ka, Ku-rɛ-thɛn cɛ wä kä Gä-lee-cia, ci Tay-täth wä kä Dal-me-cia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ Luk kärɔaadɛ tekɛ ɣä kɛɛl ɔ. Käni Mak, kä no̱o̱ŋni jɛ kɛ ji̱ kɛɛl, kɛ ɣöö derɛ ɣä ben luäk kɛ la̱tdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cä Ti-ki-käth jäk kä Ɛ-pɛ-thäth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wi̱i̱ wä ben, no̱o̱ŋni luɔ̱t in cä ba̱ny kä Kar-päth kä Ti-ro-ath, amäni buɔkni bä, kä min di̱t görä kɛ jɛ ɛ dua̱l gɔ̱rä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci A-lek-dhan-der min la bël la̱ŋni, ɣä lät kä riɛk mi di̱i̱t, bi Kuäär ni Yecu ɛ culikä kɛ kui̱ lätnikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amäni ji̱n bä niɛkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ jɛ, kɛ ɣöö cɛ ruacda lo̱k ɛlɔ̱ŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ga̱ŋdä mëë nhiam thilɛ ram mi ci ɣä luäk, kä duundɛ ɣöö cu nɛy diaal ɣä ba̱ny piny. Akɛ /ca kuɛth kɛ jɛ! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuäär ni Yecu cuɔ̱ŋ gekädä, kä cuɛ ɣä ka̱m buɔ̱m ɛn ɣöö kɛ ɣä bä ruac kɛɛliw lat, kä bi Jur diaal ɛ liŋ. Inɔ cua ɣä luäk thok luɔny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi Kuäär ni Yecu ɣä ka̱m raar kä jiäk diaal, kä bɛ ɣä kän kɛ kui̱ kuäärädɛ nhial. A puɔny tekɛ jɛ amäni cäŋ kɛl! Inɔnɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ner in jɔak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ner Pɛ-ri-thil-ä kɛnɛ A-kui-lä amäni ji̱ dhɔaar O-nɛ-thi-po-räth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Ɛ-rath-täth duɔth kä Ko-rinth, kä cä Ti-ro-pi-mäth ba̱ny piny a tëëkɛ juey kä May-li-täth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luäŋ ɣöö bi ben a /ken jiɔam ni cop. Yu-bu-läth kɛnɛ Pu-dɛn, kɛ Lay-näth, kɛ Ki-lɔ-dia amäni dämanikɔn tin Krith-cini lät kɛn ji̱ maalɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Kuäär ni Yecu tekɛ yiëëdu kɛɛl. A puɔ̱th tekɛ ji̱ kɛɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
